1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,695
A young couple move into a crowded street.

2
00:00:02,695 --> 00:00:10,755
On one side, a Macedonian family who shout so loudly that for six months the newcomers think they are murdering each other.

3
00:00:10,755 --> 00:00:11,692
They are not.

4
00:00:11,692 --> 00:00:12,890
They are just talking.

